Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下 {\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が {\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.80,0:02:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.80,0:02:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鶇 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.40,0:02:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.70,0:02:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個要了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.83,0:02:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}悔恨的雨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.60,0:02:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚對不起了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都沒有空聯繫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.20,0:02:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,結果一直喝到早上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.20,0:03:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有早飯吧 那我到下面去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.10,0:03:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我開動了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.10,0:03:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今年一定要去哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.70,0:03:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.40,0:03:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 我一個人去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.30,0:03:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.30,0:04:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎啊 小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.90,0:04:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鶇買的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.70,0:04:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,攝影集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.60,0:04:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼貴的東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.80,0:05:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 又來了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心情不好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們不覺得有些不安嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.50,0:05:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 步美已經離開那麼多年了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.10,0:05:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 那麼年幼的小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.50,0:05:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看 現在已經能那麼拿手地做這栗子飯了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天不是你太太的忌日嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是前妻而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這事你怎麼會…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.30,0:06:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天小鶇來學栗子飯的做法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.30,0:06:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說是媽媽最喜歡喫的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:12.50,0:06:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從學生時代就認識了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.30,0:06:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有了孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.50,0:06:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是年輕的代價吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.60,0:06:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教授會的報告是下一期的看點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.70,0:06:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,採訪被人拒絕就輕易放棄了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.90,0:06:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田那個傢伙好像搞砸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才發那麼大火啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.00,0:06:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說來對方怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.90,0:06:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫小川 到去年爲止一起學語言學的文靜女生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們到底明不明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.80,0:06:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小 小川步美小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.80,0:06:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請和我交往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,性格和柴田完全相反
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.20,0:07:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是柴田對她一見鍾情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.90,0:07:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把兩年的感情都發泄在這裏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.00,0:07:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有空說些閒事的話就快去校稿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大概要陪他到早上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.90,0:07:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.00,0:07:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.10,0:07:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.50,0:07:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.50,0:07:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.80,0:07:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.00,0:07:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.00,0:07:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在衆目睽睽之下你突然那樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.90,0:08:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我沒有想到這點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.20,0:08:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不會在你面前出現了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.80,0:08:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保證
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.70,0:08:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 如果我可以的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然 完全沒問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.30,0:08:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到我們裏面柴田那小子會第一個結婚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不算是那麼意外的事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.00,0:08:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他對步美小姐是一往情深
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.50,0:08:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.30,0:09:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竹下前總理家裏來了東京地檢的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎會有大事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.00,0:09:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.60,0:09:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.40,0:09:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能那就是不祥之兆吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.40,0:09:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,林紀子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:55.40,0:09:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第七中央賓館
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.40,0:10:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鶇 小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.40,0:10:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧 小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.80,0:10:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 沒事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.90,0:10:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是臉色不太好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.80,0:10:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微休息一會兒吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.40,0:10:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女又告訴我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.60,0:10:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這次地方和名字都有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.90,0:10:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告訴阿一的話 他一定會去阻止地獄少女的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.40,0:10:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過可能他會理解地獄少女的所作所爲是正確的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.60,0:10:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是哪裏不舒服嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像也沒有食慾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.10,0:10:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是那樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.60,0:11:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.80,0:11:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去打個電話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.60,0:11:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇打來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.70,0:11:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要好好道歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.30,0:11:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那麼簡單的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.50,0:11:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.80,0:11:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,林紀子 第七中央賓館
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.90,0:11:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是地獄少女嗎 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.20,0:11:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,記我帳上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.90,0:11:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的 紀子我已經住厭了現在的公寓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,風景也不是很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.60,0:11:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了知道了 我幫你買
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.40,0:11:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊 真是個奢侈的女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.10,0:11:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正圭一你很有錢嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第七中央賓館
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻煩快點 事態緊急
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.90,0:12:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.30,0:12:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過安全駕駛更重要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.30,0:12:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請儘量快點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.90,0:12:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.40,0:12:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 堵車了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:32.10,0:12:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人你是做媒體的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.60,0:12:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.20,0:12:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.90,0:12:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我開出租車還沒過半年
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.50,0:12:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過做媒體的人我還能看得出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.80,0:12:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從早到晚 連回家看看的時間都沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,確實就是那種感覺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人你們家也很辛苦吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.80,0:13:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.80,0:13:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 馬上就去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要出去嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某個的發電廠發生了事故
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.50,0:13:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有眉目了我打電話給你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.00,0:13:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡着就行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.40,0:13:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家裏交給你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.00,0:13:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七點回來 會打電話的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.60,0:14:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這孩子出生的話 也許他會比現在稍微…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.00,0:14:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鶇出生後阿一也沒有變呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.70,0:14:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不僅如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.10,0:14:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲有了孩子比以前工作得更賣力了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.00,0:14:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,步美是多麼難過啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.90,0:14:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久等了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.50,0:14:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.30,0:14:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒 沒什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.60,0:14:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.20,0:14:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第七中央賓館
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.80,0:14:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.60,0:14:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去蹲點嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.40,0:14:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.20,0:15:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天 我和平時一樣好幾天沒有回家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.80,0:15:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在蹲點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.80,0:15:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以廉潔著稱的政治家傳言暗中有外遇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等 等等 柴田怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開我 前輩	
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.80,0:15:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.10,0:15:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是誰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.80,0:15:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.90,0:15:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 柴田 住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.60,0:16:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追查外遇的男人的老婆正是那個外遇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是個笑話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人 發票
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.50,0:16:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紀子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.80,0:16:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.50,0:16:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:33.60,0:16:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 長衫準備好了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.90,0:16:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道你做了什麼嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把一個人送進地獄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愛她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.20,0:17:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是對她來說我只是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.00,0:17:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 所有男人只不過是搖錢樹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.80,0:17:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種女人怎麼能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:11.50,0:17:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能原諒的對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.70,0:17:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她趁我上班的時候和男人搞外遇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:19.50,0:17:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前輩你也看到的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.70,0:17:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且還丟下鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.10,0:17:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你也替小鶇想想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是需要母親的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要搞外遇的母親
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:33.40,0:17:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最痛苦的是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.80,0:17:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從上大學時開始我就只喜歡她一個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.30,0:17:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,與其品味這痛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.40,0:17:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如當初沒遇到她好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:47.90,0:17:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以索性要她消失好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:52.50,0:17:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使自己也會被送下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.70,0:18:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 這位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.80,0:18:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我一起的 突然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,變成錢了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.30,0:18:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是挺好的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對你來說男人就是錢吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位先生 請救救我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.40,0:18:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,錢嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.50,0:18:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五日元也可以的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.90,0:18:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多蠢的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.10,0:18:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:08.80,0:19:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.60,0:19:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你來做什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想重歸於好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.60,0:19:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背叛過的人還能相信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.80,0:19:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無論如何都不行嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:28.40,0:19:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.50,0:19:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我也不想讓你見鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.30,0:19:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 別再讓我見到你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.10,0:20:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.90,0:20:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.70,0:20:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這邊 這邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.60,0:20:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:38.70,0:20:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有你最喜歡的錢的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.00,0:20:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 你永遠出不去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.60,0:20:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心火燭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:57.60,0:21:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.90,0:21:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.10,0:21:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.90,0:21:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:25.20,0:21:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明都是那些男人們主動接近我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我要受這份罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在的你不會有人想要接近了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:43.10,0:21:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:45.60,0:21:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.10,0:22:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨也只能換來空虛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:02.70,0:22:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以復仇是不可以的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:07.90,0:22:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不要說委託別人去復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:11.90,0:22:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不能認同
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.80,0:22:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:49.80,0:22:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.40,0:23:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.90,0:23:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.40,0:23:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.30,0:23:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ {\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ {\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:46.40,0:23:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:50.20,0:24:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.20,0:24:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:08.10,0:24:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:31.00,0:24:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.80,0:24:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 真的是她嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.20,0:24:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼受人愛戴和喜歡的那個姑娘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.10,0:24:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會被送進地獄嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.10,0:24:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了別人努力工作的她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.30,0:24:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.90,0:24:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼會這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.50,0:24:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 我開始混亂了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}病房之光
